117\" /></a> <a aria-label=\"opscode.com website\" href=\"http://www.opscode.com/\"> <img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/opscodelogo.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a> <a aria-label=\"persistentsys.com website\" href=\"http://www.persistentsys.com/\"> <img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/persistentlogo.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a> <a aria-label=\"puppetlabs.com website\" href=\"http://www.puppetlabs.com/\"> <img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/puppetlabslogo.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a><a aria-label=\"seagate.com website\" href=\"http://www.seagate.com/\"> <img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/seagatelogo2.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a> <a aria-label=\"sds.samsung.com website\" href=\"http://www.sds.samsung.com/index.jsp\"><img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/samsungsds-logo.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a> <a aria-label=\"hortonworks.com website\" href=\"http://hortonworks.com/\"> <img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/hortonworks.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a><a aria-label=\"seamicro.com website\" href=\"http://www.seamicro.com/\"><img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/amd-seamicro.png\" width=\"283\" height=\"117\" /></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<hr /><h2>Startup Sponsors</h2>\n<p><a aria-label=\"hastexo.com website\" href=\"http://www.hastexo.com/\"> <img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/hastexologo.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a> <a aria-label=\"pistoncloud.com website\" href=\"http://www.pistoncloud.com/\"> <img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/pistonlogo.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a> <a aria-label=\"gridcentric.com website\" href=\"http://gridcentric.com/\"> <img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/gridcentriclogo.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a> <a aria-label=\"nebula.com website\" href=\"https://www.nebula.com/\"> <img src=\"/assets/sponsors/portland/nebulalogo.jpg\" width=\"156\" height=\"117\" /></a> <a aria-label=\"cloudbase.it website\" href=\"http://www.cloudbase.it/\"> <img sr